WEBVTT

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.770
I'm Ulbrion Unit One.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:10.810
I was tasked with an 
intelligence mission.

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:12.580
Which means I'm a spy.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:18.740
I've researched all of St. Piria's 
Princess Ecarlate Juptris's

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.280
tastes, fetishes, preferences, 
likes and dislikes.

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:25.310
And I finally found it.

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:28.840
I'm Ulbrion Unit Two.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.640
I was tasked with a destruction mission.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:34.900
Based on Unit One's information, 
I've started my mission

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.720
to create a rift between 
St. Piria and Jugglaburk.

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:18.930
Who would have thought that

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:20.680
a princess of St. Piria 
would have such a weakness.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.210
I thought she had a firm resolve,

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:23.730
but in the end she's just a little girl.

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:26.180
To think she destroyed the 
alliance over a nose hair.

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:28.730
The Jugglaburk territory is 
no longer allied with the empire

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:29.940
and has declared war against it.

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:32.440
It seems the empire has accepted 
their declaration of war.

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:35.570
It looks like everything is going 
according to plan, Archbishop.

00:01:36.190 --> 00:01:41.450
Yes, but this was all only 
possible because we

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:45.950
created these man-made 
Hyperions, the Ulbrion.

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:47.530
There are three units.

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:49.460
I thought the mission was 
carried out by two units.

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:51.300
I'm Ulbrion Unit Three.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.420
I was tasked with a scribe mission.

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:56.220
I filmed the work of Units One and Two.

00:01:56.530 --> 00:02:01.030
Now let us sit back and watch as the two sides

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:03.120
crush each other.

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:05.460
Come.

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:06.370
What is it, Unit Four?

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:08.980
A rat has snuck in.

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:52.380
What are you sneaking and 
sniffing around here for?

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.710
A knight from the order.

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:57.590
You're not allowed in here.

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:01.010
Why don't you tell me 
why you're doing so sneakily?

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:05.600
Out of my way!

00:04:14.070 --> 00:04:17.350
<i>I can't believe this.
 Me, in this state...</i>

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:20.610
Knights are a thing of the past.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.990
From here on out, 
it's the age of the Ulbrion.

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:24.660
Ulbrion?

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.820
Let's play with him a little more.

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:30.260
What the—

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:35.850
He disappeared!

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.350
What's going on?

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:42.310
What are we going to do now?

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:43.570
I don't know.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:47.280
I don't even know what's going on.

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:51.790
Sheesh, where are Gustave and 
Variation at a time like this?

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:54.610
This is bad.

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:55.600
Go away!

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.730
There's someone here!

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:00.410
What?

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.530
What are we going to do now?

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.630
We have no choice but to move back

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:09.030
to the empire's territory for now...

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:10.280
What? Really?!

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.990
Okay. Okay.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.040
Got it.

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:17.580
Who are you always talking to?

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:19.810
Okay, I'll tell the others.

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:23.220
Say what?

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:25.850
Something surprising is 
going to happen, but you

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:27.470
don't have to be shocked.

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:28.890
What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:31.680
What is this? Is this what you meant?

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:33.280
This is the beginning.

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:38.650
I'm shocked!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:41.980
Huh?

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:46.470
My own room?

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:49.430
What was I doing?

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:51.790
Playing a game?

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:53.970
Wait, I was talking to someone.

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:55.250
Please...

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.120
Please, lend me your power.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:01.260
I remember now!

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:02.850
If you help me,

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:05.130
you can have something that I've

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:07.760
treasured all my life.

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:12.330
Yes, this is it! I'll take it!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:15.790
Wait, after this I...

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:23.710
Where am I?

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:27.530
These are the remains of 
what was once the capital.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:30.780
Who are you?

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:35.590
Oh, it's you!

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:36.830
You were the one who called me!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.490
Yes. I've been always been watching you.

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:43.400
Huh, really? 
Wow, that's flattering. Really?

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:43.840
Yes.

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:48.580
<i>She's even more... She's even 
sexier than I imagined.</i>

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.760
<i>Wait, she really wants me?</i>

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.130
I asked you to come to this world

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:55.720
because I wanted to 
ask you for something.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:59.660
Oh, yeah. You had a favor 
to ask. What was it?

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:01.410
Please save this world.

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:05.730
I don't really know how to do that.

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:10.420
A single man is trying to 
bring doom to this world

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:12.610
by orchestrating the final war.

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:16.950
Wait, wait. The scale of 
the story is too big.

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:19.770
Let's sort this out, okay?

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:21.230
First, from the beginning.

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:22.900
Did you summon me here?

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:23.970
Yes.

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:24.940
How?

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:27.180
Using techniques that have
existed since ancient times.

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:30.340
Um, by the way, who are you?

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:31.170
A mystery.

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:31.910
What?

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:33.670
I am the mysterious woman.

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.380
Um...

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:38.150
If you don't want to, 
I will not force you.

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:39.750
Wh-What are you talking about?!

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:41.890
You're fine! No, I want it to be you!

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:43.800
In order to defeat him,

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:46.150
you'll probably have to 
put your life on the line.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:47.730
Oh, that?

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:52.580
I don't really want to put 
my life on the line.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:54.430
Would you like to return to your world?

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:56.160
What? I can go home?

00:07:58.220 --> 00:07:59.870
Please stand over there.

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:02.540
Woot! Yay!

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:04.750
Wait, wait! Self!

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:07.300
Is it really okay to go back like this?

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:10.760
I've worked so hard and suffered 
so much, so many times,

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:13.210
so can I really go home empty-handed?

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:15.010
Keeping my DT...

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:19.080
Um, you'll grant me a favor, too, right?

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:21.080
Yes, if I am suitable.

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:22.740
You're fine!

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:24.200
No, I want it to be you!

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:27.020
So about that...

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:31.140
If I help you out, I might die, right?

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:34.090
I believe that you will be fine.

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:35.910
That's what I hope, too.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:39.520
But should I die like this, 
I'll have huge regrets!

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:42.160
Should that happen,
 I'll pray for your soul.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:43.600
No, wait, wait.

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:45.230
It's not about what happens after I die.

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:50.320
It's before D-E-A-T-H, death, 
happens! Before that!

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:52.680
DT! I can't die without losing it!

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:56.700
I'm sure that you'll be able 
to do it and fulfill my wish.

00:08:57.860 --> 00:09:01.260
So the reward's only available 
after I complete it, go figure.

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:03.460
Well, I guess it can't be that easy.

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:05.440
Yes, it won't be easy.

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:08.480
Success or death...
Or to just got home right now...

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:09.440
Excuse me,

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.570
the others are about to wake up.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:14.000
Okay.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:16.880
Pet? What, you know her?

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:20.300
I was following you guys 
because she told me to.

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:23.140
I was giving reports about your status

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:24.680
and helping you here and there.

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:26.210
All because she asked me to.

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:27.820
So you were a spy?

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:30.400
Don't put it like that.

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:32.360
I was an observer, an observer.

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:35.840
Observer? Please, you pretended 
you couldn't talk the whole time!

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:40.090
Where am I?

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:41.060
Where am I, my ass!

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:43.430
Where have you been this whole time?!

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:47.690
Me? I was at a hostess club. 
I was at a hostess club.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:48.590
What?!

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:51.360
You abandoned your mission 
to go to a hostess club?!

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:54.760
I'm sorry. I just couldn't resist.

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:57.880
You fool! How did you even manage 
to become part of Incognito?

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:01.370
So, where are we? What happened?

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:03.120
We don't know, either.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:05.410
What's going on?

00:10:06.970 --> 00:10:07.820
A passage?

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.170
Erec-sama?

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:11.480
We have no choice but to go.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:17.510
Sainglain, are you sure?

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:20.180
We can't stay locked up 
in there forever, either.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:28.770
What?! It's you!

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:29.520
Who is that?

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:31.320
Alma Flora!

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:34.680
Not really. That's just a nickname.

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:36.150
A nickname?

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:38.150
I'm the mysterious woman.

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:40.040
So fishy.

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:44.390
But she's the one who granted 
me the powers of a Hyperion.

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:46.380
What?! You?!

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:48.830
DT?! Why are you here?!

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:49.920
Stop saying that!

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:53.080
I'm seriously torn because of that!

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:54.500
Kon! You're safe!

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.420
Wait, Erec and his men are there, too!

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:57.510
Guys!

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:03.220
Wait, wait! 
Listen to what we have to say first.

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:05.850
I've always been watching you.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.870
What? That wasn't just me?

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:08.980
Who are you?

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:10.980
I'm the mysterious woman.

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:16.070
I'll tell you about Ixion now.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:23.280
In the ancient past, 
there was a race called Ixion.

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:26.080
They controlled the Alma Energy freely,

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.530
and created a sophisticated 
civilization.

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:30.310
However, eventually 
a civil war broke out

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:32.180
and the civilization perished.

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:37.000
And now, someone who is
 trying to recreate that technology

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.510
to instigate a war has appeared.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.730
A war?

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:43.210
That person won't get their hands dirty,

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:44.910
and instead is orchestrating 
a war between the

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:46.430
pro- and anti-empire factions.

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:49.520
I was supposed to stop that. 
Well, I failed.

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:52.240
Princess, you were screwed.

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:55.520
No! The princess hasn't 
been screwed yet!

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:57.630
You mean by Nabokov, right?

00:11:57.630 --> 00:12:01.110
But the Ulga Sorority did 
screw her. With a nose hair.

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:03.440
How do you know about that?!

00:12:03.440 --> 00:12:05.480
I found out in their headquarters.

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:08.170
They created a complete profile for you

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:10.200
and planted a nose hair on Nabokov.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:11.000
What?!

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.180
What are you talking about, Variation?

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:16.470
Erec-sama, the ones who 
are plotting this war

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:18.130
are the higher-ups of the sorority.

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:22.380
The archbishop of the Ulga Sorority 
is the one pulling the strings.

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:24.340
The sorority?

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:25.430
I can't believe it!

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:28.260
We were supposed to be 
knights fighting for peace!

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:32.400
The archbishop is trying to use 
ancient technology in this war.

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:36.230
To stop him, I summoned 
someone from another world

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:39.020
and I bestowed upon another 
the power of the Hyperion.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:40.090
You mean me...

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:41.070
...and DT?

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:42.530
I told you to stop calling me DT!

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:46.630
Yes, but the archbishop is more 
powerful than I previously imagined.

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:50.060
Which is why I must call 
upon all of you here.

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:53.240
Please help stop this war as Hyperions.

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:55.410
When you say "all of you," 
you mean us, right?

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:56.620
Or us?

00:12:56.620 --> 00:12:58.290
I mean all of you.

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:01.760
I don't think I'm exactly 
what they meant by Hyperion.

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.710
I heard it takes an 
incredibly brutal regimen

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:05.550
to turn a normal person into a Hyperion.

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:09.050
No, I heard it requires an 
incredibly painful ritual.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:10.170
You mean it hurts?

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:10.680
Oh, no!

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:13.650
How was it, Erec-sama?

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:17.660
Well, in my case, I was 
chosen based on the promise

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:20.690
of my qualifications and effort, 
so it wasn't really anything.

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:22.230
Your qualifications and your effort?

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:23.690
That's our Erec-sama.

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:26.070
Sounds like someone got 
Daddy to pull some strings.

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:28.750
I bet you getting chosen was random.

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:32.330
And because of that, we're out.

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:34.960
You are all already Hyperions.

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:36.580
You've already made it.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:37.710
Since when?!

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:40.710
Since you were transferred here.

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:41.710
Wha?

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:46.060
I used a special power to 
transform you into Hyperions.

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:49.470
This way, anyone may 
use the Alma Energy.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:50.450
Anyone?

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:51.940
Anyone?

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:53.720
Then why was I chosen?

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:56.690
I did take your qualifications and effort 
into account to some degree.

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:57.810
Some degree, you say?

00:13:59.140 --> 00:14:00.550
Looks like all your

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:03.790
qualifications and effort got taken 
into account to some degree.

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.370
Some degree...

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:06.490
Anyone...

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:09.850
In order for a Hyperion to 
release their true power,

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:11.740
Alma Gear is needed.

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:15.480
Luckily, there is still some Alma 
Gear leftover in these ruins,

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:17.750
from the days of the civil war.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:20.470
Please find a weapon that suits you.

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:21.990
Let's go.

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:23.670
Are you sure you want 
to do this, Princess?

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:26.370
The sorority screwed me!

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:27.780
You think I'm going to let 
them get away with that?!

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:28.840
Princess, please wait!

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:29.510
Please wait!

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:31.540
Let's go, too.

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:32.300
Erec-sama!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:33.140
Let's go.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:35.520
It's great that we can 
get Alma Gear for free.

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:36.790
What a deal.

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:37.670
Wait!

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:39.400
We haven't decided to 
fight the sorority and...

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:40.360
Anyone?

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:45.130
So, if we make your wish come 
true with this huge group...

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:47.650
Will you listen to my wish?

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.490
Kon, you are special.

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:53.490
Special?

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:56.660
You are not of this world.

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:59.000
I guess that's true.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:03.500
And yet I am asking you to risk 
your life to save our country.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.870
I knew it.

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:08.130
Success or death, huh?

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.410
That's the problem.

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:12.890
That's the biggest problem 
when you're young.

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:25.180
So there's Alma Gear inside this thing?

00:15:25.180 --> 00:15:27.480
It's full of it! Simply full of it!

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:29.040
It's a treasure trove.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:30.740
But how do we get it out?

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:33.030
Don't you just turn this thing?

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:35.030
I'll do it.

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:47.410
Burn, my Alma!

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:51.220
Wow, that's incredible!

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:53.760
I guess we really did become Hyperions!

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:57.680
So qualifications and effort 
mean what, exactly?

00:16:02.950 --> 00:16:03.780
I can't do it.

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:04.940
Outta the way!

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:09.180
Alma!

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:10.190
He's got it.

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:11.450
Anyone?

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:16.760
Erec-sama, please!

00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:20.690
<i>As knights of the Ulga,</i>

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:24.640
<i>we can't really fly the banner 
of rebellion, however,</i>

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:27.400
<i>what exactly is our 
order's great cause?</i>

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:32.690
<i>As those who are proud to bring peace,
 isn't it possible this fight is just?</i>

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:34.180
<i>Looking at it that way,</i>

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:36.730
<i>it is the sorority who has deviated 
from our moral obligations,</i>

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:39.170
<i>which means that we are not traitors.</i>

00:16:39.170 --> 00:16:44.570
<i>In fact, the act of doing just things 
is the proof of a knight's loyalty,</i>

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:48.820
<i>but no matter how 
you spin that loyalty...</i>

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:50.550
My turn!

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:55.120
Go!

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:56.000
We're counting on you.

00:16:56.670 --> 00:16:57.530
Go for it!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:58.580
Don't stop now!

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:00.840
<i>If I fight, I may die.</i>

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:02.500
<i>If I go home, my life will be safe,</i>

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.280
<i>but then my DT will be safe, too.</i>

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:07.690
<i>I guess it's wrong in the first 
place that I have to fight,</i>

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:10.230
<i>but then wishing that I 
had learned kendo or judo</i>

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:12.360
<i>isn't really an option, either,</i>

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:16.330
<i>since I became an indoor recluse 
because I couldn't do it.</i>

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:20.350
<i>So now that my big chance is finally 
here, I don't really know what to do.</i>

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:23.430
It's no use!

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:23.930
Let me do it.

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:26.400
You're going to give it a try, Princess?

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:28.430
In the name of the moon!

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:29.320
Taste my revenge!

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:31.590
Good luck, Princess!

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:33.070
If anyone can do it, it's you!

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:35.570
<i>They're giving it all they've got, too.</i>

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:43.040
Crap!

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:45.200
Princess, please stop!

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:46.420
Let me give it one more try.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:53.050
No, it's going to break!

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:54.080
Hey!

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:54.760
Stop!

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:09.900
One Hyperion, two Hyperions...

00:18:16.300 --> 00:18:17.400
Stop it, Princess!

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.500
Leave this to me!

00:18:20.650 --> 00:18:21.710
I knew it!

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:23.280
You need to put money in there!

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.290
It won't turn otherwise,
 it's the same here as in my world.

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:29.410
Oh.

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:30.190
I see, money.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.930
They say money makes the world go round!

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:34.050
Good one, Kon!

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:35.670
Here you go, Princess.

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:36.220
Thanks.

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:41.300
Hey, how much you got on you?

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:42.600
Why would I have any?

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:43.850
Hang on.

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:50.520
What do you think, Princess?

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:51.310
I don't like it.

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:51.730
Next!

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:56.400
Next.

00:18:58.050 --> 00:18:59.950
Man, that's a duplicate.

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:00.780
Next.

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:02.240
We've still got plenty of money.

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:05.450
Isn't money just wonderful?

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:06.970
Wow, that's so lame.

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:08.510
I don't like it.

00:19:08.510 --> 00:19:09.560
Throw it away.

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:10.570
Next.

00:19:10.570 --> 00:19:13.620
Erec-sama, do you have any money on you?

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:15.560
All right!

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:23.250
This is great!

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:25.810
Hey, what about this stuff?

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:30.620
Finders keepers!

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:31.570
Hey!

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:32.380
I want this one!

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:33.500
I'll take this one!

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:38.780
I will now return you all to 
the place where you came from.

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:40.860
Actually, I'd prefer not to go there.

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.740
Definitely, please do 
send me back there!

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:43.910
The hostess club again?!

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:45.180
That reminds me.

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:45.910
Erec-sama!

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:48.110
There's something I'd 
like to report to you.

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:50.660
The sorority has... Hyperion...

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:53.390
I beseech thee.

00:19:53.390 --> 00:19:55.170
Please put a stop to this war.

00:20:07.550 --> 00:20:09.880
She really did return us 
to where we were.

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:10.810
We came back.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.520
Came back...

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:16.240
But where is the place 
we must return to?

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:18.050
I swore an oath of 
fealty to the sorority

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:20.820
because I had seen the 
truth in their teachings.

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.540
I can still remember 
that immense inner joy

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:23.640
I felt when I made that oath, and yet...

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:26.330
Can you please hurry up and 
decide what you want to do?

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:31.950
Then you are going to 
fight for this world?

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:35.560
I've gotten pretty 
entangled in this world.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:37.870
I couldn't just ditch everyone now.

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:41.010
And if I left now, I would 
always harbor this regret.

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:44.510
Please! Make me a man!

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:53.390
I'll make you a man.

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:58.090
I know it's your first time,
 but you'll be fine.

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:00.000
Don't worry, I'll show you the ropes.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.310
Stop!

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:05.110
Anyone who's survived a 
battlefield is a man.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:06.770
Oh, that's what you mean?

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:08.570
You see, I was talking about...

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:09.340
What?

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:10.920
Um, well...

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:13.160
Then I'm counting on you all.

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:16.670
If you ever need my 
help, you can tell Pet.

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:17.980
Let's go.

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:22.260
Kon, I pray that we will meet again.

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:23.220
Me, too!

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:25.230
I pray that I'll meet you again, 
that you'll make me into a man,

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:27.000
and that I'll get home safe and sound.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:27.930
Oh, yeah.

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:30.010
How do I get to Olvidia?

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:32.020
Going there is no longer possible.

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:32.900
Huh?

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:34.020
What do you mean?

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:36.440
It is currently sealed.

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:38.190
You can't get inside.

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:39.590
What is that supposed to mean?

00:21:39.590 --> 00:21:43.150
I went through all sorts of 
trouble to get to Olvidia!

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:44.980
Please just forget about it.

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:48.070
What kind of story element is that?!

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:49.780
What about our troubles?!

00:21:50.050 --> 00:21:50.780
Goodbye.

00:21:57.310 --> 00:21:59.710
What was the point of 
coming to Jugglaburk?!

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:01.700
We're back to where we came from?

00:22:02.360 --> 00:22:03.570
I guess we have no choice.

00:22:03.570 --> 00:22:06.350
Let's go fulfill her wish

00:22:06.350 --> 00:22:08.250
in order to fulfill mine!

00:22:08.480 --> 00:22:10.800
Are you sure we can trust that woman?

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:12.770
She helped us!

00:22:12.770 --> 00:22:15.310
She calls herself the mysterious woman.

00:22:15.490 --> 00:22:17.180
I guess that is sort of suspicious.

00:22:18.160 --> 00:22:19.980
What the hell, guys? 
Come on, believe in her!

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:21.070
She's a good person.

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:24.070
But she screwed you.

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:25.920
I remain unviolated.

00:22:25.920 --> 00:22:28.320
She is my first!

00:22:28.640 --> 00:22:29.820
So did she violate you?

00:22:30.020 --> 00:22:31.070
She didn't!

00:22:31.640 --> 00:22:33.830
What, you still haven't...?

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:24.860
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.700 --> 00:24:12.180
Hey, can I ask you a question?

00:24:12.450 --> 00:24:13.090
Yes?

00:24:13.090 --> 00:24:14.520
Why didn't you just tell me

00:24:14.520 --> 00:24:16.640
to save the world from 
the very beginning?

00:24:16.640 --> 00:24:20.090
I watched over you until 
you reached the point where

00:24:20.090 --> 00:24:21.600
you believed yourself 
capable of doing it.

00:24:21.600 --> 00:24:23.180
That's so fishy!

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:30.320
Variation is being chased 
by the Ulga Sorority

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:30.320
when he's saved by someone who 
says that he was sent by Erec.

00:24:30.320 --> 00:24:35.400
During that escape, he recalls

00:24:30.320 --> 00:24:35.400
the day when Incognito was founded.
